      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}\n\nI understand your skepticism. My suggestions truly come from a player's perspective, driven by a simple hope for a better VRChat experience: higher clarity, richer colors, and more advanced face and eye tracking. While I admit this view may not be grounded in a rigorous business analysis, it stems from a genuine desire to see the platform thrive. Ultimately, if developing for Vision Pro proves too difficult for the team, and if not pursuing it is truly better for VRChat's future, then I would fully support that decision.",
