  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-12-02T08:23:26.778Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Dear VRChat Team,\n\n  Here’s my feedback and suggestion in hopes it helps VRChat earn more in the long run.I was happy to see the mobile version released, but I believe the current iOS/iPad version can only serve as a temporary step. For new users, its appeal is limited because true stereoscopic 3D and real presence are the soul of VRChat.I sincerely hope the team can adapt the existing iOS/iPad version into a proper Apple Vision Pro version. Converting an iOS app to a visionOS VR build should be relatively straightforward, and with Vision Pro’s best-in-class chip, face tracking, and eye tracking, it would bring an incredible experience and attract a large number of high-end users. This will definitely deliver long-term and lasting revenue growth for VRChat.As a first step and to build hype before the full Vision Pro version launches, please allow Vision Pro users to download and run the current iPad version. I’m confident that once a significant portion of Vision Pro owners become active VRChat users, Apple itself will notice and be willing to support and promote you.I truly believe this direction will make VRChat even greater. Thank you so much for listening!Best regards,\n\n[A VRChat user who really wants the platform to thrive]",
